    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "disconnecting doesn't really work though. it's not about needing a weekend off or a vacation. i can go to a beach in bali and i'll just be thinking about the quarterly projections or the next crisis. it's deeper than that. it feels like the version of me that actually cared about things... that person is just gone. there's nothing left to recharge. it's like trying to reboot a system that has no hardware left.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
